{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-6-3","kind":"proposition","title":"角平分线定理及其逆命题","englishTitle":"If an angle of a triangle be bisected and the straight line cutting the angle cut the base also, the segments of the base will have the same ratio as the remaining sides of the triangle; and, if the segments of the base have the same ratio as the remaining sides of the triangle, the straight line joined from the vertex to the point of section will bisect the angle of the triangle.","book":6,"number":3,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.3","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.3/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":3,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-6-3@raw-445a8775ffe8254b","contentId":"euclid-6-3","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"445a8775ffe8254b35866f1c0c4d14a5e6459fbed420f78f92202830f6af5fc4","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-6-3.statement","euclid-6-3.construction.1","euclid-6-3.construction.2","euclid-6-3.proof.1","euclid-6-3.proof.2","euclid-6-3.proof.3","euclid-6-3.proof.4","euclid-6-3.proof.5","euclid-6-3.proof.6","euclid-6-3.proof.7","euclid-6-3.proof.8","euclid-6-3.proof.9","euclid-6-3.proof.10","euclid-6-3.proof.11","euclid-6-3.conclusion","euclid-6-3.historical.1","euclid-6-3.historical.2","euclid-6-3.historical.3","euclid-6-3.historical.4","euclid-6-3.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-6-3.statement","contentId":"euclid-6-3","revisionId":"euclid-6-3@raw-445a8775ffe8254b","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9e8f0c8bbe3e1974584476ff34db1f539f162593f6771f3b722a9a27b692a198","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If an angle of a triangle be bisected and the straight line cutting the angle cut the base also, the segments of the base will have the same ratio as the remaining sides of the triangle; and, if the segments of the base have the same ratio as the remaining sides of the triangle, the straight line joined from the vertex to the point of section will bisect the angle of the triangle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果三角形的一个角被两截,直线切开角底边,底边的区段将具有与三角形其余两侧相同的比例;如果底边的区段与三角形其余两侧的区段具有相同的比例,从顶端连接到区域点的直线将分解三角形的角。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"三角形任以直线分一角为两平分而分对角边为两分则两分之比例若馀两边之比例三角形分角之线所分对角边之比例若馀两边则所分角为两平分"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个三角形被直线分割并且一个角被平分，将对角线分为两个，则两边的比例就被平分。如果三角形与其他两边成比例，则由三角形的这条线分割的对角边的比例也被平分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-3.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-6-3","revisionId":"euclid-6-3@raw-445a8775ffe8254b","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"19f20d8f7ce5ae11cde77b8c2ba19944468e96e0a2422a42da60cceba23b8071","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC be a triangle, and let the angle BAC be bisected by the straight line AD; I say that, as BD is to CD, so is BA to AC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC成为三角形,让BAC角被直线AD分界线两切;我说,BD对CD的比等于BA对AC的比；BD 与 CD 之比等于 BA 与 AC 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-3.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-6-3","revisionId":"euclid-6-3@raw-445a8775ffe8254b","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eebb08eaefbe9aa531d34c38489eba58f47e84e59a28b8a1fa1fd64da5bbc552","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let CE be drawn through C parallel to DA, and let BA be carried through and meet it at E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"CE通过C,DA平行,BA通过E通过。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-3.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-6-3","revisionId":"euclid-6-3@raw-445a8775ffe8254b","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"13bdc46ab3f3c8994b2dd106a3dfe8adce3d6048c8384a5a9ec41e23ecd631a9","citations":["euclid-1-29"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since the straight line AC falls upon the parallels AD, EC, the angle ACE is equal to the angle CAD. [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"直线AC相交 平行线AD,EC 角度ACE等于角度CAD [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-3.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-6-3","revisionId":"euclid-6-3@raw-445a8775ffe8254b","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0fe24aa53edc27fdd47845f2485fec48c353151ffa0918b28672291f94751bfd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle CAD is by hypothesis equal to the angle BAD; therefore the angle BAD is also equal to the angle ACE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但CAD角度是假设等于BAD角度,因此BAD角度也等于ACE角度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-3.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-6-3","revisionId":"euclid-6-3@raw-445a8775ffe8254b","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"af2ebc4114f634cf7237e68a8a95ce82e2fad9722c7194a27da2f155004bd6e9","citations":["euclid-1-29"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since the straight line BAE falls upon the parallels AD, EC, the exterior angle BAD is equal to the interior angle AEC. [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于BAE线直线相交,平行线AD,EC,外部角度BAD等于内部角度AEC。 [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-3.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-6-3","revisionId":"euclid-6-3@raw-445a8775ffe8254b","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"53f9e4db64d48e5e220496d1f71b69eb20000e635d6e8bcee467baf963155118","citations":["euclid-1-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle ACE was also proved equal to the angle BAD; therefore the angle ACE is also equal to the angle AEC, so that the side AE is also equal to the side AC. [[I. 6](/principles/euclid-1-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但ACE角也与BAD角相等;因此,ACE角也等于AEC角,因此AE角与AC角也相等。 [[I. 6](/principles/euclid-1-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-3.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-6-3","revisionId":"euclid-6-3@raw-445a8775ffe8254b","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ee74ba5c96e28b83662b02b018126377e12596f91a9235dee9d037f3a44c1cfd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AD has been drawn parallel to EC, one of the sides of the triangle BCE, therefore, proportionally, as BD is to DC, so is BA to AE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AD比EC,BCE三角形的一面, 比例上,BD比DC等于BA比AE；BD 与 DC 之比等于 BA 与 AE 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-3.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-6-3","revisionId":"euclid-6-3@raw-445a8775ffe8254b","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"10eb1ecadb86113309cd111fd570e0371894f3cca6b6472ce87ad7903a8bf7a5","citations":["euclid-6-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AE is equal to AC; [[VI. 2](/principles/euclid-6-2)] therefore, as BD is to DC, so is BA to AC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AE等于AC;因此,BD对DC的比等于BA对AC的比；BD 与 DC 之比等于 BA 与 AC 之比。 [[VI. 2](/principles/euclid-6-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-3.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-6-3","revisionId":"euclid-6-3@raw-445a8775ffe8254b","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"12a337675e9c1560c20d0fbca561973d9911ac67960d4b008e4b45c2a7523af2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, let BA be to AC as BD to DC, and let AD be joined; I say that the angle BAC has been bisected by the straight line A.D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BA比AC等于BD比DC,AD连接;我说,BAC的角度被第A.D直线分两部分；BA 与 AC 之比等于 BD 与 DC 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-3.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-6-3","revisionId":"euclid-6-3@raw-445a8775ffe8254b","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1958e501352dd30223fc274a65cb289cba384360bc154193fdc3d4b98ab41294","citations":["euclid-6-2","euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, with the same construction, since, as BD is to DC, so is BA to AC, and also, as BD is to DC, so is BA to AE : for AD has been drawn parallel to EC, one of the sides of the triangle BCE: [[VI. 2](/principles/euclid-6-2)] therefore also, as BA is to AC, so is BA to AE. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样的建筑工程,BD对DC的比等于BA对AC的比,BD对DC的比等于BA对AE的比:AD比EC,三角形BCE的一个侧线:因此,BA对AC比BA对AE；BD 与 DC 之比等于 BA 与 AC 之比；BD 与 DC 之比等于 BA 与 AE 之比；BA 与 AC 之比等于 BA 与 AE 之比。 [[VI. 2](/principles/euclid-6-2)] [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-3.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-6-3","revisionId":"euclid-6-3@raw-445a8775ffe8254b","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"58cdd4b53a2a7fe0ae2464b0dd69ab66f395daaea889224c6da86e5c04e75231","citations":["euclid-5-9","euclid-1-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore AC is equal to AE, [[V. 9](/principles/euclid-5-9)] so that the angle AEC is also equal to the angle ACE. [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AC等于AE,AEC的角度也等于ACE的角度。 [[V. 9](/principles/euclid-5-9)] [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-3.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-6-3","revisionId":"euclid-6-3@raw-445a8775ffe8254b","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9089370f3e2eacca6390b930395fe818cf24645e95954cfbf3d8bd3298309ff2","citations":["euclid-1-29"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle AEC is equal to the exterior angle BAD, [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)] and the angle ACE is equal to the alternate angle CAD; [id.] therefore the angle BAD is also equal to the angle CAD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AEC角等于外角BAD,ACE角等于内错角 CAD;因此,BAD角也等于外角CAD。 [[I. 29](/principles/euclid-1-29)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-3.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-6-3","revisionId":"euclid-6-3@raw-445a8775ffe8254b","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8312de44c4704e19996ef4ecb30182efdaf4f55a540052c180b7dcae906ac023","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the angle BAC has been bisected by the straight line AD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BAC角被直线AD线分两部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-3.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-6-3","revisionId":"euclid-6-3@raw-445a8775ffe8254b","order":14,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-3.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-6-3","revisionId":"euclid-6-3@raw-445a8775ffe8254b","order":15,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"115e9718917dbf2f8a09d0f0629fcf5fc0e45d0404e185794526c66f22d75485","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"三角形任以直线分一角为两平分而分对角边为两分则两分之比例若馀两边之比例三角形分角之线所分对角边之比例若馀两边则所分角为两平分"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果一个三角形被直线分割并且一个角被平分，将对角线分为两个，则两边的比例就被平分。如果三角形与其他两边成比例，则由三角形的这条线分割的对角边的比例也被平分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-3.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-6-3","revisionId":"euclid-6-3@raw-445a8775ffe8254b","order":16,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9a3ab25d85efec41c887d780054f91e37d2f4923ab6be0d2fb39a9e5c31c7af6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"先解曰：甲乙丙角形以甲丁线分乙甲丙角为两平分题言乙丁与丁丙之比例若乙甲与甲丙"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先，解释如下：甲乙丙，三角形由线 甲丁 和角 乙甲丙 平分。命题解释：乙丁 与 丁丙 的比例，如果 乙甲 和 甲丙"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-3.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-6-3","revisionId":"euclid-6-3@raw-445a8775ffe8254b","order":17,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"017cde75e0196fa059ac40570d2783254c2dcd7231a4f832da643d6fbd97c435","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试作乙戊线与甲丁平行次于丙甲线引长之至戊其甲乙戊与乙甲丁为平行线相对之两内角等外角丁甲丙与内角戊亦等〈一卷廿九〉今乙甲丁与丁甲丙又等即甲乙戊角与戊角亦等也而甲戊与甲乙两腰亦等矣〈一卷六〉则戊甲与甲丙之比例若乙甲与甲丙也〈五卷七〉夫戊甲与甲丙之比例若乙丁与丁丙也〈本篇二〉则乙甲与甲丙之比例亦若乙丁与丁丙也〈五卷十一〉后解曰乙丁与丁丙之比例若乙甲与甲丙题言甲丁线分乙甲丙角为两平分"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：试验：线 乙戊 平行于 甲丁，线 丙甲 延伸到 戊。甲乙戊 和 乙甲丁 是平行线，面对两个相等的外角。丁甲丙 和 戊 也相等。〈一卷廿九〉 现在 乙甲丁 和 丁甲丙 相等，这意味着 甲乙戊 和 戊 的角也相等，并且 甲戊 和 甲乙 的边也相等。〈一卷六〉 然后 戊甲 与 甲丙 的比例也为 〈五卷七〉。如果 戊甲 是 乙丁 与 丁丙 的比例，则 〈本篇二〉 然后 乙甲 与 甲丙 的比例也与 乙丁 和 丁丙 类似。〈五卷十一〉 解释如下：乙丁 与 丁丙 之间的比例如下：如果 乙甲 和 甲丙 是命题，甲丁 是线分割，且 乙甲丙 是角平分线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-3.historical.4","contentId":"euclid-6-3","revisionId":"euclid-6-3@raw-445a8775ffe8254b","order":18,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9720b567709ba9339d498424603b2eb94976f78e4989a271f3d7994fea687029","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：依前作乙戊线与甲丁平行而引丙甲线至戊其乙甲与甲丙之比例既若乙丁与丁丙甲丁线又与戊乙边平行而乙丁与丁丙之比例若戊甲与甲丙〈本篇二〉即乙甲与甲丙之比例亦若戊甲与甲丙〈五卷十一〉是戊甲与乙甲两线等矣〈五卷〉〈九〉则甲乙戊角与戊角亦等也〈一卷五〉夫甲乙戊与乙甲丁为平行线相对之两内角等而外角丁甲丙与内角戊亦等〈一卷廿九〉则乙甲丁丁甲丙两角必等"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：根据以前的方法，直线 乙戊 与 甲丁 平行，且直线 丙甲 被画到 戊。如果 乙甲 与 甲丙 的比值与 丁丙甲丁 平行且与 戊乙 平行，并且 乙丁 与 丁丙 的比值成立，那么 戊甲 与 甲丙〈本篇二〉 的比值，即 乙甲 与 甲丙，也相等，如果 戊甲 和 甲丙〈五卷十一〉 等于 戊甲 和 乙甲 〈五卷〉〈九〉。然后 甲乙戊 与 戊 的角度也相等。〈一卷五〉 和 乙甲丁 是平行线，具有两个对内角，同时外角 丁甲丙 与内角 戊 相等。随后 〈一卷廿九〉，乙甲丁丁甲丙 的两个角必须相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-3.source","contentId":"euclid-6-3","revisionId":"euclid-6-3@raw-445a8775ffe8254b","order":19,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c5280ac9662d8bd325d489a59704a1bd208c3b258de8bf7a7b753c0757d714a6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.3/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.3\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-6-3:euclid-1-29:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-3","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-3.proof.1","euclid-6-3.proof.3","euclid-6-3.proof.10"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-29","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.3","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.3/","sourceLabel":"I. 29"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-6-3:euclid-1-6:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-3","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-3.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-6","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.3","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.3/","sourceLabel":"I. 6"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-6-3:euclid-6-2:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-3","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-3.proof.6","euclid-6-3.proof.8"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-2","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference",